      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Nimesulide has been tested by the Authors on a group of 40 adults patients of both sexes that had undergone oral surgery. After careful clinical observation it was established that this drug has an excellent analgesic effect and is also effective as an antiedemigen and antiflogistic therapy. Furthermore the total tolerability of Nimesulide was established after noting the absence of gastroenteric or allergy symptoms."},
